{"id":"suegra","lemma":"suegra","pos":"noun","rank":4619,"glosses":["one Salvadoran colón; the coin of that value","heel, butt (of a loaf of bread)"],"ipa":"/ˈsweɡɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"suegras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-suegra.wav","examples":[{"text":"Odio a mi suegra.","en":"I hate my mother-in-law.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459741","words":[{"g":"hate"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Me llevo muy bien con mi suegra.","en":"I'm getting along with my mother-in-law very well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599181","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},null,null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"my"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"very well"]]},{"text":"Le voy a presentar a mi suegra.","en":"I'm going to introduce you to my mother-in-law.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522073","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to present, to submit"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"No sé cómo aguantas a tu suegra.","en":"I don't know how you put up with your mother-in-law.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1154905","words":[null,null,{"g":"how"},{"g":"to hold","l":"aguantar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"your"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"I don't know"]]},{"text":"Mi suegra me da escalofríos.","en":"My mother-in-law gives me the creeps.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1187967","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"chill, shiver","l":"escalofrío"}]}]}